Package: naughty-schnitzel-extension
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, nautilus, python3-nautilus
Description: Nautilus menu entry to show or hide hidden files
 Adds an item to the background context menu of Nautilus that toggles
 the display of hidden files.
